          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#SixOperationsYoga Six operations yoga
          %p
            Discussion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/six+operations+yoga"} six operations yoga
            for pull-push of (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coherent+D-module"}> coherent
            ,
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holonomic+D-module"} holonomic
            = succeed ")." do
